    "body": "@ramonpetgrave64, thanks for the feedback. There are two suggestions here, so I'll tackle them one at a time:\n\n1. It seems you're requesting the addition of `--ref` and `--commit` flags. What do you envision these flags doing? As stated in [this comment](https://github.com/cli/cli/issues/9590#issuecomment-2349968502), you can extract the information you need using the `--format json` flag (as it seems you are doing with your `jq` implementation). What would you see the behavior of `gh attestation verify --ref --commit` do differently?\n2. You've suggested adding `--jq-exit-status` to simplify the command above. I don't think this is something we'd specifically add to `gh attestation verify` and instead make available everywhere, but that is well outside the scope of this issue. If it is something you'd like to see generally, I suggest opening another issue ",
