    "body": ">But it’s also important to have the same corresponding behavior the signing workflow. \n\n👍, I elided those flags for simplicity. This is why we added the signer-repo and signer-workflow flags.\n\n>Propagation could be done the same way that many folks already do when they look to pin the hashes against the actions and reusable workflows in their yaml files. See [instructions](https://www.stepsecurity.io/blog/pinning-github-actions-for-enhanced-security-a-complete-guide#how-to-pin-github-actions-2). But I agree that the GitHub UI could make this flow at least one step a shorter.\n\nAh, I was hoping you had a specific need/use case. \n\nCheers,",
